{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 1, "text": "I have completed a full source-fidelity and internal consistency review of the entire patent application draft. The review traced every claim limitation, every numbered part in the description and figures, and every asserted technical structure and relationship in the specification and figure briefs to the affirmative inventor source documents. The review also checked for internal consistency across all draft files.\n\nWhile the draft is largely faithful to the inventor's disclosure, I found one instance where the detailed description and a figure brief assert a specific technical topology that is not supported by the source documents. I also found several internal inconsistencies within the brief for FIG. 4, where the descriptions of flowchart shapes and their corresponding numeral leaders are ambiguous or contradictory. These findings are detailed below with specific, actionable fixes to bring the application into compliance."}
